### Campus Help Desk API - REST Client Test File
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/requests

### 1. GET all requests
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. POST create a new request
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@campus.edu",
  "category": "IT & Wi-Fi Network",
  "description": "Wi-Fi is not connecting in Library 2nd Floor study lounge.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### 3. POST create a second request
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Ananya Patel",
  "email": "ananya.patel@campus.edu",
  "category": "Hostel & Housing",
  "description": "Hot water geyser in Block B room 304 is malfunctioning.",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### 4. GET single request by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 5. PUT update request by ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@campus.edu",
  "category": "IT & Wi-Fi Network",
  "description": "Wi-Fi router was rebooted but still intermittent in Library 2nd Floor.",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### 6. DELETE request by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1
